@BackEndTea thanks for the feedback in https://github.com/symfony/ai/pull/2591#issuecomment-5809476685. You are right that an agent can combine tool calls with a bash loop itself, and that the resource reads were the real case. The command now takes `{"resource": "<uri>"}` next to `{"tool": ...}`, so one call can read several collectors of a profile. Each entry reports its own `ok` and `error`, and the exit code is non-zero when any call failed.
